@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy";
}

<div class="col-lg-8 px-0">
    <h1 class="h3 mb-3">Privacy</h1>
    <p>EasyShop is a graduation project. It keeps only the information needed to run the store: your name, email address, phone number, delivery addresses and your orders.</p>
    <p>Passwords are never stored in plain text. Each one is hashed with a random salt before it is saved.</p>
    <p>The sign-in cookie only identifies you to this site and expires after a few hours of inactivity. Nothing is shared with third parties.</p>
</div>
